4. LOCAL AI PROCESSING & PRIVACY INTEGRITY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CuteCut Pro is engineered with an emphasis on user privacy and on-device compute:
  a. On-Device Execution: Machine learning pipelines (speech alignment, Whisper,
     audio spectrum rendering, and subtitle sync) execute locally on the user's
     hardware without sending user media to external servers without consent.
  b. Privacy: The Software does not harvest, sell, or monetize user data.

